{
    "title": "Bookshelf-Your virtual library",
    "description": "Organize book collection by creating virtual shelves and tags.\r\nTrack your reading progress and set reading goals to stay motivated.\r\nManage a wishlist of books that you want to read (TBR).\r\nDiscover great new reads: rate, review and share book recommendations.\r\nCreate your own social profile and allow friends to follow your reading journey.\r\n\r\nNote: This is a library management app, NOT AN EBOOK READER.\r\n\r\nBookshelf is a free service with a sleek, functional and user-friendly interface.\r\nThere is no limit on number of books and all essential features are free.\r\nSome advanced features are covered by Bookshelf Pro subscription plans.\r\n\r\nORGANIZE YOUR BOOKS\r\n- Catalog books using fast and easy to use ISBN barcode scanner\r\n- Batch scanner option allows to rapidly scan multiple books at once\r\n- Books can be added using search functionality (title/author/ISBN)\r\n- Old and rare books can be added manually\r\n- Import books from a CSV file generated by other popular book apps\r\n- Import books from Goodreads\r\n\r\nCREATE SHELVES AND TAGS\r\n- Organize books by creating virtual bookshelves and tags\r\n- Use search functionality to quickly find books on your shelves\r\n- Sort your books by title, author, number of pages, publication date, etc.\r\n- Use filters to display books matching your criteria\r\n- Track your lent and borrowed books\r\n- Add information about your book purchases\r\n- Organize books by series and volumes\r\n- Create personal notes or add other useful information\r\n- Add quotes by simply scanning the text with our OCR reader\r\n- Multiple book selection; apply batch operations\r\n- Grid view available\r\n- Dark theme available\r\n\r\nSET CUSTOM READING GOALS\r\n- Create annual reading goals to stay motivated\r\n- Define custom date range goals and share them with your friends\r\n\r\nTRACK YOUR READING\r\n- Log how many pages you have read so far and when did you start and finished reading a book\r\n- You can record multiple readings for each book\r\n\r\nSEE WHAT YOUR FRIENDS ARE READING\r\n- Create your own reading social profile\r\n- Allow your followers to see your last read books, wishlist and reading goals\r\n\r\nDISCOVER NEW BOOKS\r\n- Discover bestselling books in different categories\r\n- Share your favorite books with your friends on social media\r\n\r\nVIEW YOUR STATISTICS\r\n- Rich statistics about your books, purchase, reading progress, ratings, top authors, top categories etc.\r\n\r\nMANAGE YOUR WISHLIST\r\n- Maintain a wishlist of books that you want to read\r\n- Book price tracking and price alerts available in some countries\r\n\r\nRATE AND REVIEW\r\n- Help others to discover great books and find books for yourself\r\n- Rate books with 5 star rating (half-star ratings available)\r\n- Read book reviews from others and leave your own opinion\r\n\r\nNEVER LOSE YOUR DATA\r\n- Your data is securely stored on our servers and it's linked to your account\r\n- If you change your device/platform, you just need to log back in with your username\r\n- You can export data to a CSV file to create your own backup\r\n- You can export your data as HTML web page for easy printing with cover images\r\n\r\nBOOKSHELF PRO PLANS\r\n- Bookshelf is free to download and use\r\n- There is no limit on number of books and all essential features are free\r\n- Some advanced features are covered by Bookshelf Pro subscription plans\r\n- Bookshelf Pro includes a 7-day free trial period after which you can choose between monthly, annual or lifetime plans\r\n\r\nOTHER NOTES\r\n- This is an app to organize your books and to track your reading\r\n- Reading is not available within this app\r\n\r\n\r\nFOLLOW US \r\nStay in touch for new features and improvements\r\n- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/bookshelfconcept/\r\n- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/bookshelfapp/\r\n\r\nFEEDBACK AND SUGGESTIONS\r\nbookshelf.concept@gmail.com\r\nhttps://www.bookshelfapp.info\r\n\r\n* Privacy policy: https://www.bookshelfapp.info/privacy-policy.html\r\n* Terms of service: https://www.bookshelfapp.info/terms-of-use.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Organize book collection by creating virtual shelves and tags.<br>Track your reading progress and set reading goals to stay motivated.<br>Manage a wishlist of books that you want to read (TBR).<br>Discover great new reads: rate, review and share book recommendations.<br>Create your own social profile and allow friends to follow your reading journey.<br><br>Note: This is a library management app, NOT AN EBOOK READER.<br><br>Bookshelf is a free service with a sleek, functional and user-friendly interface.<br>There is no limit on number of books and all essential features are free.<br>Some advanced features are covered by Bookshelf Pro subscription plans.<br><br>ORGANIZE YOUR BOOKS<br>- Catalog books using fast and easy to use ISBN barcode scanner<br>- Batch scanner option allows to rapidly scan multiple books at once<br>- Books can be added using search functionality (title/author/ISBN)<br>- Old and rare books can be added manually<br>- Import books from a CSV file generated by other popular book apps<br>- Import books from Goodreads<br><br>CREATE SHELVES AND TAGS<br>- Organize books by creating virtual bookshelves and tags<br>- Use search functionality to quickly find books on your shelves<br>- Sort your books by title, author, number of pages, publication date, etc.<br>- Use filters to display books matching your criteria<br>- Track your lent and borrowed books<br>- Add information about your book purchases<br>- Organize books by series and volumes<br>- Create personal notes or add other useful information<br>- Add quotes by simply scanning the text with our OCR reader<br>- Multiple book selection; apply batch operations<br>- Grid view available<br>- Dark theme available<br><br>SET CUSTOM READING GOALS<br>- Create annual reading goals to stay motivated<br>- Define custom date range goals and share them with your friends<br><br>TRACK YOUR READING<br>- Log how many pages you have read so far and when did you start and finished reading a book<br>- You can record multiple readings for each book<br><br>SEE WHAT YOUR FRIENDS ARE READING<br>- Create your own reading social profile<br>- Allow your followers to see your last read books, wishlist and reading goals<br><br>DISCOVER NEW BOOKS<br>- Discover bestselling books in different categories<br>- Share your favorite books with your friends on social media<br><br>VIEW YOUR STATISTICS<br>- Rich statistics about your books, purchase, reading progress, ratings, top authors, top categories etc.<br><br>MANAGE YOUR WISHLIST<br>- Maintain a wishlist of books that you want to read<br>- Book price tracking and price alerts available in some countries<br><br>RATE AND REVIEW<br>- Help others to discover great books and find books for yourself<br>- Rate books with 5 star rating (half-star ratings available)<br>- Read book reviews from others and leave your own opinion<br><br>NEVER LOSE YOUR DATA<br>- Your data is securely stored on our servers and it&#39;s linked to your account<br>- If you change your device/platform, you just need to log back in with your username<br>- You can export data to a CSV file to create your own backup<br>- You can export your data as HTML web page for easy printing with cover images<br><br>BOOKSHELF PRO PLANS<br>- Bookshelf is free to download and use<br>- There is no limit on number of books and all essential features are free<br>- Some advanced features are covered by Bookshelf Pro subscription plans<br>- Bookshelf Pro includes a 7-day free trial period after which you can choose between monthly, annual or lifetime plans<br><br>OTHER NOTES<br>- This is an app to organize your books and to track your reading<br>- Reading is not available within this app<br><br><br>FOLLOW US <br>Stay in touch for new features and improvements<br>- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/bookshelfconcept/<br>- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/bookshelfapp/<br><br>FEEDBACK AND SUGGESTIONS<br>bookshelf.concept@gmail.com<br>https://www.bookshelfapp.info<br><br>* Privacy policy: https://www.bookshelfapp.info/privacy-policy.html<br>* Terms of service: https://www.bookshelfapp.info/terms-of-use.html",
